OL,3,CProgramme listings for TUE 19 MAY
OL,4,G2200FNight Tracks
OL,5,     GSara Mohr-Pietsch presents an
OL,6,     Gadventurous, immersive soundtrack
OL,7,     Gfor late-night listening, from
OL,8,     Gclassical to contemporary and
OL,9,     Geverything in between.
OL,10,G2330F'Round Midnight
OL,11,     GLondon-based drummer,
OL,12,     Gpercussionist and bandleader Jas
OL,13,     GKayser, sitting in for Soweto
OL,14,     GKinch, spotlights some of the new
OL,15,     Gjazz releases and classics that
OL,16,     Gshe has been enjoying.
OL,17,G0030FThrough the Night
OL,18,     GFrom the Brasov Early Music
OL,19,     GFestival, the SEMPRE Early Music
OL,20,     GEnsemble plays music by Vivaldi.
OL,21,     GJohn Shea presents.
